OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWinds strengthening to gale
OL,6,Fforce with a risk of storm force over
OL,7,Fthe Outer Hebrides. A cloudy morning
OL,8,Fwith some light, patchy rain. Rain
OL,9,Fturning heavy and more persistent in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon, especially in the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGales easing but remaining
OL,13,Fwindy overnight, especially across the
OL,14,FOuter Hebrides. Cloudy with rain,
OL,15,Fheavy at times, spreading
OL,16,Fsoutheastwards. Turning drier
OL,17,Fovernight with clear spells and
OL,18,Fshowers in northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
