OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,6,Fdeveloping during the day but these
OL,7,Finterspersed with cloudier conditions
OL,8,Fand showers, which may be heavy. Still
OL,9,Fbreezy but winds generally easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and showers early Friday, then
OL,13,Fdrier with clearer skies later. Mostly
OL,14,Fdry with sunny spells and light winds
OL,15,Fthrough the weekend. Chillier nights
OL,16,Fthan of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
